  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Quality education in Madagascar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">While most children in Madagascar do attend school, the standard of education is inconsistent and schools are often under-resourced and overcrowded. Our project aims to improve the education of women and children in the Nosy Be region through classroom support and educational workshops.  We aim to improve access to educational resources for teachers and students as we strive to make a positive impact on the lives of families and, through education, empower them for a better future.</narrative>
  </description>
